OL,3,GNEWSABridge demolition plan 'smacks of
OL,4,Aincompetence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage group says the planned
OL,7,Fdemolition of two former railway
OL,8,Fbridges "smacks of incompetence".
OL,10,FStockton Council plans to demolish both
OL,11,Fthe Crawford's and Black Squares
OL,12,Fbridges on the Castle Eden Walkway in
OL,13,FWynyard this autumn, pointing to deep
OL,14,Fcracks and movement that presented a
OL,15,Frisk of collapse.
OL,17,FCampaigners The HRE group said the
OL,18,Fbridges, which date back to Victorian
OL,19,Ftimes, should be protected and
OL,20,Fmaintained and demolition would be an
OL,21,F"appalling waste of money".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
