OL,3,GNEWSABridge demolition plan 'smacks of
OL,4,Aincompetence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Nigel Cooke, cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor environment, leisure and culture,
OL,8,Fsaid the cost of demolition was
OL,9,F"significantly lower than the estimated
OL,10,Fcost of repairing and maintaining the
OL,11,Fstructures".
